ative, D arrogance, A unorganized. So likely C remains best.\n\nThus we can agree with Agent 1, but maybe add nuance: highlight that while C's communication difficulty is a concern, the other candidates have more severe deficits. So we maintain vote for C.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 1's point. Provide evidence: reliability 100%, quick correct decisions, positive crew atmosphere. Also note concerns.\n\nThus produce public message: \"I agree with Agent 1, recommending Candidate C, because ...\". Vote C.\n\nLet's produce output."}
